{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20977","headline":"石城晓 · 李贺","name":"石城晓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月落大堤上，女垣栖乌起。\n细露湿团红，寒香解夜醉。\n女牛渡天河，柳烟满城曲。\n上客留断缨，残蛾鬬双绿。\n春帐依微蝉翼罗，横茵突金隐体花。\n帐前轻絮鹤毛起，欲说春心无所似。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}